The '''Klegger Corp Mining Facility''', also known as the '''KCM installation'''<ref name="BMF17">{{BuildFalconCite|17|Guide to the Galaxy}}</ref> or the '''Mustafarian Mining Complex''',<ref name="Master Models: Scenes">''[[Star Wars Master Models: Scenes]]''</ref> was an [[ore]] collection complex located on the [[planet]] [[Mustafar]].

==Description==
Valuable ores were mined from the lava and are extracted in different ways. The facility used electromagnetic extraction technologies as well as manual [[Mustafarian]] and droid extraction. Owned by the [[Techno Union]],<ref name="Visual Dictionary" /> the [[mining]] facility was used as cover for the [[battle droid]] [[Techno Union droid factory|factory]] concealed inside the [[mountain]] upon which the mine sat. A secret command center was built onto the mining complex to serve as a final redoubt for the [[Executive Separatist Council|Separatist Council]].<ref name="Complete Locations">[[Star Wars: Complete Locations (2016)|''Star Wars: Complete Locations'']]</ref>

==History==
{{Quote|I am sending you to the Mustafar system in the Outer Rim. It is a volcanic planet. You will be safe there.|General Grievous sends the Separatist Council to the Mustafarian Mining Complex|<ref name="Episode III" />}}
[[File:SeppyWarRoom-Ep3.png|thumb|left|247px|The Klegger Corp Mining Facility was the final base of the Separatist Council.]]
Shortly before the [[Battle of Utapau]], [[General]] [[Grievous]] was instructed to send the Separatist Council to the mining complex for their safety. Little did they know, [[Darth Sidious]] was sending the council there so they could be easily disposed of later. There, the council was [[Mission to Mustafar|slain]] by [[Anakin Skywalker|Darth Vader]], a [[Sith Lord]], ending the [[Clone Wars]]. Shortly after, the complex was the site of a [[Duel on Mustafar|duel]] between Vader and [[Jedi Master]] [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]].<ref name="Episode III" /> The wanton damage of their confrontation<ref name="Complete Locations" /> compromised the system controlling the protective [[repulsor field]]s that kept the facility from melting in Mustafar's extreme heat<ref name="Master Models: Scenes" /> and most of the complex was consumed by [[Volcano|volcanic]] eruptions.<ref name="Complete Locations" />

In [[3 ABY]],<ref name="Timelines">''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]''</ref> after Palpatine left him on Mustafar without his left arm and either of his legs, Vader crawled into the complex. He had flashbacks of his [[Mission to Mustafar|mission]] to kill the [[Executive Separatist Council|Separatist Council]]. There, with the help of [[MSE-6 series repair droid|mouse droids]], he replaced his missing limbs with spare parts. [[Ochi|Ochi of Bestoon]] arrived to kill Vader, and the pair dueled fiercely.<ref name="Vader 7">[[Darth Vader (2020) 7|''Darth Vader'' (2020) 7]]</ref>

